    <string name="google_drive_title">Connect Google Drive</string>
    <string name="google_drive_setup_steps">1. Tap Sign in with Google.\n2. Choose the Google account you want to use on this device.\n3. The selected Google profile is used to identify the active user in the shared account store.\n4. Local storage remains available from the menu whenever you want to switch back.</string>
