    <string name="microsoft_drive_title">Connect Microsoft Drive</string>
    <string name="microsoft_drive_setup_steps">1. Create a public client/app registration in Microsoft Entra ID or Azure.\n2. Paste the application client id below.\n3. Choose a credential passphrase for the encrypted local session.\n4. Keep local storage as the default mode until the mobile browser callback is completed.\n5. The desktop app already uses the same Microsoft Drive scopes for browser sign-in.</string>
